and exact specifiers allow (mcp, opentelemetry-*, boltons, peewee, wcmatch,
click, tomli, jsonschema, exceptiongroup, ruamel.yaml.clib). Turn them into
lower bounds with the same minimum version. Other pins are unchanged.

